es didn't display properly in File Manager in some cases\nFix: An issue where WeChat couldn't access screenshots in some cases\nFix: Stuttering when loading multilingual screenshot thumbnails in some cases\nFix: An input field display issue when renaming a custom card in Smart cards in Dark mode\nFix: Overlapping buttons in Smart cards in some cases\nOptimization: The timeliness and accuracy of weather location updates when your location changes\nNew: One-tap upload in Gallery to submit your work to the Xiaomi Imagery Global Awards Curated with Leica\n*To use this feature, make sure Security is version 12.3.1-260225.0.1 or later, and Mi Store is version 5.49.0 or later\n[Interconnectivity]\nNew: Xiaomi phones now support AirPods, including fast pair pop-ups, battery status, Spatial Audio, noise cancellation switching, and Find My\nNew: On Mac, Xiaomi Interconnectivity now lets you view Xiaomi Cloud Notes"},{"cn":"malachite","rg":"China","br":"Stable","m":"Recovery","v":"OS3.0.3.0.WOOCNXM","an":"16.0","d":"2026-01-30","sz":"7.2 GB","md5":"1f6b2b6aadd4a71baaa43fecf3d5a707","u":"https://bigota.d.miui.com/OS3.0.3.0.WOOCNXM/malachite-ota_full-OS3.0.3.0.WOOCNXM-user-16.0-1f6b2b6aad.zip"},{"cn":"malachite","rg":"China","br":"Stable","m":"Fastboot","v":"OS3.0.3.0.WOOCNXM","an":"16.0","d":"2026-01-23","sz":"9.3 GB","md5":"d04c5bbe019abe1e4868429da6ac96e0","u":"https://bkt-sgp-miui-ota-update-alisgp.oss-ap-southeast-1.aliyuncs.com/OS3.0.3.0.WOOCNXM/malachite_images_OS3.0.3.0.WOOCNXM_20260123.0000.00_16.0_cn_d04c5bbe01.tgz"},{"cn":"malachite","rg":"China","br":"Stable","m":"Recovery","v":"OS3.0.2.0.WOOCNXM","an":"16.0","d":"2025-12-10","sz":"7.1 GB","md5":"20bb8d0382f42475fc350ef7e8f76ca0","u":"https://bigota.d.miui.com/OS3.0.2.0.WOOCNXM/malachite-ota_full-OS3.0.2.0.WOOCNXM-user-16.0-20bb8d0382.zip"},{"cn":"malachite","rg":"China","br":"Stable","m":"Fastboot","v":"OS3.0.2.0.WOOCNXM","an":"16.0","d":"2025-11-29","sz":"9.1 GB","md5":"bfaf3f28cc3ecc91ca69eb4ddbed2a9f","u":"https: